,"type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":26,"created_at":"2025-03-27T01:12:07Z","updated_at":"2025-04-07T13:46:54Z","closed_at":"2025-04-07T13:46:49Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.4.1.stable [49a5bc7b6], 4.4.1.rc1, 4.4.1.rc2, 4.5.dev1.\n- **Not reproducible in**: 4.4.stable, 4.3.stable, 4.2.stable, 4.1.stable.\n\n### System information\n\n- Windows 10 (10.0.19045)\n- NVIDIA - GeForce GTX 1050 Ti (27.21.14.5720)\n- Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-8750H CPU @ 2.20GHz, 2201 Mhz, 6 Core(s), 12 Threads\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen creating a new project and trying to open it, the editor simply closes by itself, this only occurs when using the Vulkan driver. Here is the editor's verbose: \n\n[editor-verbose.txt](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19481450/editor-verbose.txt)\n\nThe problem is not limited to editor, games on this version are also affected, in MRP (see at the end) it is possible to test the drivers and modes, here is the result:\n\nMode | Driver | Command | Works\n--- | --- | --- | ---\nForward+ | Vulkan | `test.exe --rendering-driver vulkan` | ❌\nMobile | Vulkan | `test.exe --rendering-method mobile` | ❌\nForward+ | D3D12 | `test.exe --rendering-driver d3d12` | ✔️\nCompatibility | opengl3 | `test.exe --rendering-driver opengl3` |✔️\n\nHere is the GAME's verbose: \n\n[game-verbose.txt](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19481538/game-verbose.txt)\n\nI also removed/disabled the NVidia driver, and performed the tests with the \"Intel(R) UHD Graphics 630\", the same failures occurred, except that the **Mobile mode worked**.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nEditor:\n- Open the Godot editor\n- Create a new project\n- Then open the project\n- The editor will close\n\nGames:\n- The game will only crash if you use Vulkan\n- Using D3D12 will not have any problems, it will work normally.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nCreate a new project and open it.\n\nTo test the problem independently you can follow the minimal example and export to Windows:\n\n[mcve-crash.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19481521/mcve-crash.zip)\n\nthen run the commands:\n\n```\ntest.exe --rendering-driver vulkan\ntest.exe --rendering-method mobile\ntest.exe --rendering-driver d3d12\ntest.exe --rendering-driver opengl3\n```","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104675/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104675/timeline","perf